{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"浴衣が好評で嬉しい！\n日本人で良かった。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/14/9105819/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/14/9105819/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/14/9105819/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/14/9105819/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆきなお誕生日おめでとう！\nゆきなの踊ってる姿だいすきなんだ〜\nライブ頑張ろうね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/14/9105819/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツアーリハの日々だよー\n頭混乱してしまうなー\n頑張らなきゃ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー楽しみだな\n初挑戦のことするしっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何だと思うー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わからんだろーな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/14/9105819/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふふふふははは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近そば食べてるー\nそば好きなんだよー\n今日も食べちゃったよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も頑張る！\n僕は鉄分摂取！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふぁー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/14/9105819/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私がちはるのこと\nちーちゃんって呼んだら\nすごーい顔してこっち見るの。\nおもしろいから\nみんなさんにも見せたいけど、、\nうん。だめだな笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/14/9105819/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後にひめちゃんも写ってぱしゃり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}